# DEFENSE IN DEPTH ONLY — NOT the primary safety mechanism.
#
# CodeUri (infra/aws/template.yaml) points at infra/aws/.lambda_src/, an
# explicitly allow-listed staged copy built by prepare_lambda_src.py, not
# at the repo root. That's deliberate: verified empirically (2026-09-08)
# that SAM CLI's Python builder did NOT reliably honor this file when
# CodeUri pointed at the repo root — it copied the whole repo, including
# a stray AWS credentials CSV and the real resume, into the build
# artifact despite these excludes. Don't re-point CodeUri at the repo
# root and trust this file alone to protect PII/secrets again.
#
# This file is kept only in case CodeUri ever points somewhere broader
# again — keep it in sync with .gitignore's intent if so.

.git/
.gitignore
.samignore
.env
.env.*
*.docx
*.pdf
data/
tests/
infra/
docs/
logs/
*.log
README.md
TECHNICAL_PLAN.txt
requirements-dev.txt
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/
